GameBrowser adaptation developed by Solomon Gbeta (https://solomon.ng).
Based on aliasmode/aliasmode commit 0361bf4d4c53c993e5df80f1e7a2b6e9eb8a3538.
Modifications: GameBrowser branding, viewport preset selector, Windows distribution and landing page, admin sharing checks, stored fingerprint seed collision checks, Windows MCP discovery, persistent profile arrangement, Admin/Follower selection styling, trusted browser action following, and saved sync sessions.

The independent GameBrowser application also upgrades the supplied standalone
StakeMode 0.1.0-preview.2 project. Its original SDK contracts, workspace functions
and licensed browser libraries are retained alongside GameBrowser's own entry,
settings, profile transfers, state import and optional Cloud composition.
